    "scenesThatPass": [
      "AMERICAN JOURNALIST’S WIFE: You’re the famous capitalist from Milan.\nFIRST WOMAN: I saw her passport. She’s fifty-two years old!\nSECOND WOMAN: Just a baby!",
      "NANNY IN WHITE: What are you doing? Go to sleep, go to sleep... you too, go to sleep.\nNANNY IN WHITE: Guidino, get under the covers. It’s cold. Be still.\nNANNY IN BLACK: Did you say your prayers?\nNANNY IN WHITE: My little sweetheart, aren’t you my little sweetheart?",
      "DINA: My friend here says...\nDINA: ...she says you can’t make a love story.\nEVA: Shut up!",
      "LUISA: My friend.\nROSSELLA: Ah.",
      "LUISA: I didn’t ask you any question. I don’t want to know anything. Just spare me the embarrassment of having to listen to you swear to a lie, as …\nROSSELLA: Was she born in March or April? She has all the characteristics of an Aries. She is really the Aries type.\nLUISA: I know what type that one is!\nROSSELLA: Yes? It’s precisely that type of woman who tends to be a good companion for weak, spineless, confused me."
    ]
  },
