        "speaker": 52,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "Avvocato, I’ve caught him."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1892,
        "text": "Yes, yes. That’s right, that’s right... I’ve got it. It’s very easy... yes everything... is as if... everyone together... me... you... oh God, how can I explain this to you? Thank you, thank you, everyone... All we have to do is not hold back... not object. It’s very easy..."
